('pass','line',35,'A season','{}','pass.scenarios.5.who'),
('pass','line',36,'The season pass costs {{f:F000694}}, or {{f:F000696}} bought by 15 November.',array['F000694','F000696'],'pass.scenarios.5.what'),
('pass','note',1,'Walkers can ride the Grandes Platières cable car for {{f:F000702}} return, and the gondolas of the Giffre valley for {{f:F000708}}.',array['F000702','F000708'],'pass.after'),
('access','heading',0,'Getting there and choosing a base','{}','access.h2'),
('access','para',0,'By the fastest road Geneva airport is {{f:F000642}} from Les Carroz and {{f:F000643}} from Flaine, Lyon airport {{f:F000719|n}} to {{f:F000720}} away and Chambéry {{f:F000721|n}} to {{f:F000722}}. The A40 motorway runs up the Arve valley to Cluses, where one road climbs south to Les Carroz and Flaine and another follows the Giffre east to Morillon, Samoëns and Sixt.',array['F000642','F000643','F000719','F000720','F000721','F000722'],'access.paras.0'),
('access','para',1,'Cluses station is the way in by train. Altibus runs the Les Carroz Flaine Express from the bus station just outside it and line Y94 up the valley to Samoëns and Sixt; Les Carroz is about ten kilometres from the station and Flaine about thirty, and Guide Ski notes that the Flaine buses run by reservation in winter. Free skibuses join Samoëns, its two gondolas and Sixt, and in Flaine free shuttles link Forêt, Les Gérats, Le Hameau and the Col de Pierre Carrée to the Forum.','{}','access.paras.1'),
('access','para',2,'Under the Loi Montagne, winter tyres or chains carried in the car are required from November to March in the listed mountain communes of Haute-Savoie. The Grand Massif Express car park in Samoëns has {{f:F000680}} spaces and charges in winter, the Vercland car park has {{f:F000681}} free spaces, and Les Carroz has about {{f:F000682}} free spaces at the foot of its slopes.',array['F000680','F000681','F000682'],'access.paras.2')) as v(section,slot,ord,body,refs,field);
